#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<seekdir()> function sets the location in the directory stream from "
#| "which the next B<readdir()> call will start.  B<seekdir()> should be used "
#| "with an offset returned by B<telldir()>."
msgid ""
"The B<seekdir>()  function sets the location in the directory stream from "
"which the next B<readdir>(2)  call will start.  The I<loc> argument should "
"be a value returned by a previous call to B<telldir>(3)."
msgstr ""
"A função B<seekdir()> define a posição da próxima chamada a readdir() no "
"fluxo de diretórios a partir do qual a próxima chamada B<readdir()> irá "
"iniciar. B<seekdir()> deve ser usada com um 'offset' retornado por "
"B<telldir()>."

